  "headBody": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><title>Building small tools | by Alice | Medium</title><meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"Medium\"></head><body><article class=\"meteredContent\"><h1 data-testid=\"storyTitle\">Building small tools</h1><div><span data-testid=\"authorName\">Alice</span></div><div>Member-only story</div><div>Mar 3, 2025</div><div>· 5 min read</div><p class=\"pw-subtitle-paragraph\">Why constraints help</p><p>Small tools are easier to hold in your head, and that is the whole argument of this post.</p><figure><div role=\"button\"><img src=\"https://miro.medium.com/a.png\" alt=\"diagram\"></div><figcaption>Diagram</figcaption></figure><div role=\"tooltip\">tip</div><div><a href=\"https://medium.com/plans?source=x\">Upgrade</a></div><div data-testid=\"headerClapButton\">Clap</div><p>Second paragraph with <a href=\"https://example.com\">a link</a> and enough words to count.</p><div>Share</div></article></body></html>\n"
